\pgmchange sends a MIDI Program Change message.
It takes three integer arguments, the MIDI port, the
channel, and the program number:

\pgmchange 1 1 41

The line above sets program 41 on channel 1 of MIDI
port 1.

The port must already be open, with \openmidiport or with
the midiport method of an instrument, otherwise you will
get a "selected MIDI port is not open" error.
The channel must be between 1 and 16, and the program
number between 0 and 127.
